# Learning Order

Do **NOT** solve these problems randomly.

Follow this progression.

```
Basic Interval DP
        ↓
Split DP
        ↓
Palindrome Interval DP
        ↓
Merge / Cut Problems
        ↓
Last Operation DP
        ↓
