# Pattern Recognition Cheat Sheet

| If the question says... | Think... |
|--------------------------|----------|
| Subarray | Interval DP |
| Substring | Interval DP |
| Merge | Split DP |
| Burst | Last Operation DP |
| Remove | Last Operation DP |
| Cut | Split DP |
| Parenthesize | Split DP |
| Palindrome | Interval DP |
| Expression | Partition DP |

