# Standard State Definitions

## Split DP

```
dp[i][j]
```

Meaning:

```
Best answer

for interval

[i...j]
```

---

## Last Operation DP

```
dp[i][j]
```

Meaning:

```
Best answer

assuming interval

[i...j]
```

---

## Palindrome DP

```
dp[i][j]
```

Meaning:

```
Answer

for substring

i...j
```

---

# Common Transitions

## Split DP

```
for every k

between

i

and

j

dp[i][j]

=

best(

dp[i][k]

+

dp[k+1][j]

+

cost
)
```

---

## Last Operation DP

Choose every

```
k
```

as the last operation.

---

## Palindrome DP

```
If characters match

↓

Shrink interval

Else

↓

Split
```

---

# Traversal Order

Always compute

```
Length = 1

↓

Length = 2

↓

Length = 3

↓

...

↓

Length = n
```

Never compute random intervals.

