# Common Transformations

Many difficult problems become Interval DP after identifying the interval.

```
Matrix Multiplication
        ↓
Split DP

Burst Balloons
        ↓
Last Operation

Merge Stones
        ↓
Split DP

Cut Stick
        ↓
Split DP

Palindrome Partition
        ↓
Substring DP

Boolean Parenthesization
        ↓
Expression Split DP
```

